WEBVTT

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:15.730
The duel between the queen, Claire Harvey,

00:00:15.730 --> 00:00:18.950
and the new student, 
Kisaragi Hayato, shall begin.

00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:22.180
Kisaragi-kun is doing this for us...

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:24.160
Please don't get yourself hurt...

00:00:24.520 --> 00:00:26.710
I will explain the rules.

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:28.390
The time limit will be fifteen minutes.

00:00:28.390 --> 00:00:31.190
The match will end when
a combatant is knocked out,

00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:33.840
or when their energy runs out
and they're disarmed.

00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:38.980
Liddy, I would like 
to declare one thing here.

00:00:38.980 --> 00:00:39.850
What is it?

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:44.690
I will not use full-body 
armament in this duel.

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:46.690
Full-body armament?

00:00:47.230 --> 00:00:50.330
A fighting tactic that only
a few people at this school can use.

00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:55.490
It releases a weapon's energy all at once
and allows the wielder to use its full capabilities.

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:58.360
The fight would be over in a second,

00:00:58.360 --> 00:01:00.740
and that wouldn't be fair 
to our audience today.

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:04.460
She's saying she's going to hold back.

00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:06.000
Emile?

00:01:06.440 --> 00:01:08.750
I'll act as your support, so don't worry.

00:01:09.230 --> 00:01:11.500
Use our plan to win, Hayato.

00:01:12.580 --> 00:01:14.010
Kisaragi Hayato,

00:01:14.470 --> 00:01:17.410
it's against the rules to 
receive help during a duel.

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:19.290
I don't mind, Erica.

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:24.220
He's a new student here. 
I'll permit it as a handicap.

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:29.260
Ten...

00:01:29.690 --> 00:01:30.690
Nine...

00:01:30.950 --> 00:01:31.690
Eight...

00:01:32.310 --> 00:01:33.400
Seven...

00:01:33.050 --> 00:01:34.690
Now, Kisaragi Hayato,

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:34.690
Six...

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:36.170
Five...

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:37.200
show me how strong you are!

00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:37.680
Four...

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:39.120
Three...

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:39.700
<i>I have no choice.</i>

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:40.440
Two...

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:41.580
One...

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:46.500
Hayato!

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:47.370
Claire-sama!

00:01:50.690 --> 00:01:51.880
Ow...

00:01:58.020 --> 00:01:58.970
Huh?

00:03:30.350 --> 00:03:35.560
<b>The Invincible Queen</b>

00:03:31.560 --> 00:03:33.660
J-J-Just

00:03:33.660 --> 00:03:35.980
wh-where do you think you're touching?!

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:37.070
Huh?

00:03:43.210 --> 00:03:46.330
S-Sorry! I'm still not able to control 
my powers that well.

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:48.290
Could you forgive me...

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:50.750
Not likely, huh?

00:03:51.150 --> 00:03:53.000
Of course I won't!

00:03:53.000 --> 00:03:56.990
I've never had anyone 
touch my ch-chest before.

00:03:57.350 --> 00:03:58.250
And you...

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:02.090
h-had the gall to fondle me?!

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:13.660
Aliceterion!

00:04:13.980 --> 00:04:15.060
Energy barrier!

00:04:20.320 --> 00:04:21.820
It seems you're at least 
a little bit capable.

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:24.950
Thanks, Emile.

00:04:24.950 --> 00:04:27.860
Why did you have to grab 
the president's boobs?!

00:04:27.860 --> 00:04:28.910
It wasn't on purpose!

00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:31.480
Why are you getting mad?

00:04:32.170 --> 00:04:33.370
Well, whatever.

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:37.960
We failed with our initial plan, 
but our plan of attack isn't incorrect.

00:04:37.960 --> 00:04:40.200
Try to charge in again, Hayato.

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:40.920
Got it.

00:04:46.890 --> 00:04:48.140
Is that all you've got?

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:49.630
Damn it!

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:52.260
Hayato, use the other move.

00:04:52.260 --> 00:04:53.010
Right.

00:04:57.640 --> 00:04:58.620
What's that?

00:04:58.620 --> 00:04:59.610
What is he doing?

00:04:59.950 --> 00:05:01.320
All that training wasn't for nothing.

00:05:11.990 --> 00:05:12.830
All right!

00:05:19.610 --> 00:05:22.590
That was more than I expected, 
Kisaragi Hayato.

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:25.300
It was worth trying.

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:28.760
However, this is the finale!

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:37.520
Hayato!

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:38.440
Kisaragi-san!

00:05:37.520 --> 00:05:38.440
Kisaragi-kun!

00:05:42.620 --> 00:05:45.640
I think we can see 
the outcome of this fight.

00:05:45.640 --> 00:05:47.150
Do you give up?

00:05:48.770 --> 00:05:50.820
N-Not yet.

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:52.330
Hayato...

00:05:52.600 --> 00:05:54.830
That's the spirit. And 
I shall respond in kind!

00:06:01.950 --> 00:06:03.000
The Buster Cannon?

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:05.800
She's going to use it against a new student?

00:06:13.190 --> 00:06:14.120
<i>This is bad!</i>

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:15.350
You can't, Hayato!

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:17.880
<i>Hayato! Hayato!</i>

00:06:16.710 --> 00:06:18.860
<i>What is going on?</i>

00:06:17.880 --> 00:06:20.390
<i>Can you hear me, Hayato?!</i>

00:06:18.860 --> 00:06:21.310
<i>My body's so hot...</i>

00:06:23.430 --> 00:06:26.240
This is the end, Kisaragi Hayato.

00:06:39.310 --> 00:06:40.540
Wh-What's going on...

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:42.870
His movements have changed.

00:06:42.870 --> 00:06:44.380
The president is being pushed back.

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:45.420
Oh?

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:49.550
But at this distance...

00:06:56.000 --> 00:06:58.050
A full-body armament...

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:02.690
And he's deploying an N-Barrier...

00:07:02.980 --> 00:07:03.890
That can't be.

00:07:03.890 --> 00:07:07.190
Kisaragi Hayato has only had 
his Hundred for two days!

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:08.610
<i>He's fast!</i>

00:07:10.540 --> 00:07:11.700
Claire-sama!

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:18.050
<i>I am the perfect queen.</i>

00:07:18.390 --> 00:07:21.000
<i>I can't lose here!</i>

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:34.270
Petal.

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:42.560
Hayato!

00:07:45.490 --> 00:07:46.940
This is the end,

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:48.690
Kisaragi Hayato!

00:08:19.630 --> 00:08:20.810
Hayato!

00:08:29.830 --> 00:08:30.870
Thank goodness...

00:08:31.340 --> 00:08:32.490
What are you trying to pull?

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:35.360
You said you weren't going to use 
your full-body armament!

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:36.870
Hold on a second, Emile.

00:08:37.590 --> 00:08:39.520
The declaration she made

00:08:39.520 --> 00:08:41.970
had nothing to do with the rules of a duel.

00:08:42.570 --> 00:08:43.530
Char...

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:45.790
I know what you want to say,

00:08:46.410 --> 00:08:49.500
but this match was won by Claire Harvey.

00:08:52.330 --> 00:08:54.600
No, I lost here.

00:08:56.210 --> 00:08:59.060
Even if I won under the rules,

00:08:59.490 --> 00:09:01.600
I lost to myself.

00:09:02.960 --> 00:09:07.480
Then how about we leave it
as a tie in the official record?

00:09:20.980 --> 00:09:23.290
<i>Where... am I?</i>

00:09:24.400 --> 00:09:25.340
<i>I...</i>

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:28.270
Hayato... Hayato...

00:09:28.630 --> 00:09:29.510
<i>Who is that?</i>

00:09:29.890 --> 00:09:30.830
I'm sorry...

00:09:31.930 --> 00:09:33.020
Hayato.

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:37.680
Have you come to?

00:09:40.460 --> 00:09:41.630
President...?

00:09:42.900 --> 00:09:46.330
I see... I lost.

00:09:46.990 --> 00:09:49.750
Then Emile and the girls 
are still getting expelled?

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:51.360
I canceled the order.

00:09:51.690 --> 00:09:52.370
Huh?

00:09:53.840 --> 00:09:55.420
I see...

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:58.860
I don't remember anything 
from halfway through.

00:10:00.120 --> 00:10:01.480
Kisaragi Hayato...

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:04.460
Just who are you?

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:05.670
H-Huh?

00:10:06.430 --> 00:10:08.160
In your first duel,

00:10:08.160 --> 00:10:10.190
you used a full-body armament,

00:10:10.190 --> 00:10:11.750
and deployed an N-Barrier.

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:14.410
You managed to corner me, the queen.

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:16.230
That shouldn't normally be possible.

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:17.760
What's going on?

00:10:18.270 --> 00:10:20.420
I-I don't know, either...

00:10:21.770 --> 00:10:22.760
Hayato!

00:10:25.300 --> 00:10:27.340
What's the meaning of this, President?

00:10:27.340 --> 00:10:29.610
Are you still trying to do 
something to Hayato?!

00:10:28.300 --> 00:10:30.020
Hey, Emile.

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:32.840
I just came to apologize.

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:35.030
Now, if you'll excuse me.

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:40.550
Hmph!

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:42.610
Hayato, are you okay?

00:10:42.610 --> 00:10:45.040
Yeah. Sorry for making you worry.

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:49.000
No, no. I'm just glad you're okay.

00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:56.020
Please don't let it get you down.

00:10:56.020 --> 00:10:57.520
If it had been a normal duel,

00:10:57.520 --> 00:11:00.130
you would have won hands down.

00:11:00.870 --> 00:11:03.410
That's not what I'm thinking about.

00:11:03.410 --> 00:11:05.400
Th-Then are you

00:11:05.720 --> 00:11:08.970
bothered by the fact that you
had your b-b-boobs touched?

00:11:08.970 --> 00:11:09.390
Wh—?

00:11:09.740 --> 00:11:13.040
That wasn't anything!

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:13.900
Erica,

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:18.010
Claire-sama isn't someone to get worked up 
because someone grabbed her boobs.

00:11:18.010 --> 00:11:19.150
Yeah, but Liddy,

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:23.660
even I haven't touched Claire-sama's 
sublime boobs for myself.

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:26.160
Th-That's enough about boobs!

00:11:26.610 --> 00:11:28.160
S-Sorry.

00:11:35.680 --> 00:11:38.330
Yep. It looks like you're fine now.

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:40.800
You worry too much.

00:11:40.800 --> 00:11:42.260
I'm fine.

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:45.870
I'm pretty hungry, though.

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:46.660
Here you go.

00:11:46.660 --> 00:11:48.290
Oh, thanks.

00:11:49.120 --> 00:11:52.480
When you use a lot of energy, 
you get hungry, supposedly.

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:53.940
I see.

00:11:55.560 --> 00:11:58.540
Hey, Hayato, do you want to go to Central?

00:11:58.540 --> 00:12:00.630
We have today off.

00:12:00.630 --> 00:12:01.490
Central?

00:12:01.980 --> 00:12:04.200
It's the <i>Little Garden</i>'s business district.

00:12:04.200 --> 00:12:06.600
I'm sure there are a lot of places to eat.

00:12:07.310 --> 00:12:09.650
Yeah. Sounds good.

00:12:09.650 --> 00:12:10.870
Yay!

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:13.070
Yay! Yay! Yay!

00:12:13.070 --> 00:12:15.540
Did you really want to go Central that badly?

00:12:15.870 --> 00:12:19.090
That's not it! I wanted to go on
a date with you that badly!

00:12:23.310 --> 00:12:26.220
I see. So this is Central.

00:12:26.620 --> 00:12:29.030
You wouldn't think we were on a ship.

00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:30.340
Hey, Emile?

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:33.000
Are we kind of standing out for some reason?

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:35.230
It's not us, it's you.

00:12:35.980 --> 00:12:38.480
Everyone was watching yesterday's duel.

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:39.880
Seriously?

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:41.990
Anyway, Hayato.

00:12:42.290 --> 00:12:43.990
Here you go. Open up.

00:12:44.350 --> 00:12:45.830
Wh-Why?

00:12:45.830 --> 00:12:47.580
Come on.

00:12:50.510 --> 00:12:51.200
How is it?

00:12:51.520 --> 00:12:54.330
It's pretty good, I guess.

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:55.360
I know, right?

00:12:55.360 --> 00:12:57.180
I'll have some of yours, too.

00:12:57.480 --> 00:12:58.600
H-Hey!

00:12:58.600 --> 00:13:01.000
Yum! Strawberry's pretty good!

00:13:01.300 --> 00:13:01.890
You know...

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:04.660
Kisaragi-kun and Crossfode-kun 
are pretty close.

00:13:04.660 --> 00:13:06.030
Kind of makes you wonder, huh?

00:13:06.030 --> 00:13:07.930
They're in the same dorm room, right?

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:08.810
Wow!

00:13:08.810 --> 00:13:11.750
Hey, Emile, let's go get some food.

00:13:11.750 --> 00:13:13.470
A-Anywhere will do.

00:13:13.470 --> 00:13:18.230
Sure, but before that,
there's one place I want to go.

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:23.740
Wow!

00:13:24.390 --> 00:13:26.160
Cool, isn't it, Hayato?

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:28.800
Yeah, but...

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:29.760
Hm?

00:13:32.760 --> 00:13:35.250
This is unmistakably a date spot, isn't it?

00:13:36.230 --> 00:13:39.050
I wanted to come here with you.

00:13:39.460 --> 00:13:41.380
I heard it had a
 great view of the ocean.

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:43.510
Wh-What?

00:13:43.870 --> 00:13:45.220
Nothing.

00:13:45.220 --> 00:13:46.590
Nothing, really.

00:13:51.060 --> 00:13:56.520
Apparently it gets even more
romantic at sundown.

00:13:57.570 --> 00:13:58.680
I... I see.

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:01.520
Your sister?

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:03.280
Y-Yeah.

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:04.340
Hello?

00:14:04.340 --> 00:14:07.280
<i>Nii-san, why didn't you tell me</i>

00:14:07.670 --> 00:14:09.030
<i>about the duel?</i>

00:14:09.640 --> 00:14:12.890
<i>Sorry. I just didn't want you to worry.</i>

00:14:12.890 --> 00:14:16.290
Everyone's talking about you 
here at the hospital.

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:20.500
So I wanted to see what happened 
when I did some fortune telling,

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:23.320
and there was an ominous shadow 
of a woman that came up.

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:27.830
<i>Are you with a girl right now?</i>

00:14:27.830 --> 00:14:29.680
N-No, I'm not.

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:30.600
Hm?

00:14:30.600 --> 00:14:32.010
<i>Are you telling the truth?</i>

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:34.070
I'm not lying.

00:14:34.070 --> 00:14:36.640
<i>Then can I check?</i>

00:14:36.640 --> 00:14:37.940
S-Sure.

00:14:38.810 --> 00:14:40.940
But how?

00:14:42.850 --> 00:14:45.030
I didn't think you'd actually come.

00:14:45.380 --> 00:14:48.140
I got permission to go outside.

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:52.070
Weren't you supposed to be alone?

00:14:52.430 --> 00:14:56.030
Oh, well, I said I wasn't with a girl,

00:14:56.030 --> 00:14:57.810
but I didn't say I was alone.

00:14:58.110 --> 00:14:59.920
Nice to meet you, Karen-chan.

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:03.460
I'm Emile Crossfode, Hayato's roommate.

00:15:03.760 --> 00:15:06.550
You're male, correct?

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:08.940
O-Of course.

00:15:08.940 --> 00:15:11.130
I'm going to get to the point.

00:15:11.130 --> 00:15:12.330
Do you...

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:15.720
...like other men?

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:17.310
Hey, Karen!

00:15:19.960 --> 00:15:23.110
So you two are really just roommates, then.

00:15:23.590 --> 00:15:26.600
You're not trying to seduce 
my brother or something, right?

00:15:26.600 --> 00:15:28.100
O-Oh, come on.

00:15:28.100 --> 00:15:31.520
Why would I? I'm a guy.

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:35.370
Well, I guess I'll leave it at that for now,

00:15:36.100 --> 00:15:39.260
but I won't forgive you if you try 
to do something to my brother.

00:15:39.260 --> 00:15:41.250
Roar. Roar roar!

00:15:42.660 --> 00:15:44.250
It's Sakura-san!

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:45.250
Sakura-san?

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:48.990
Yeah, it's the idol, Kirishima Sakura-san.

00:15:48.990 --> 00:15:51.260
I listened to her songs 
in the hospital today.

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:53.950
She's really popular right now.

00:15:53.950 --> 00:15:55.760
I love her.

00:15:56.370 --> 00:15:59.270
They're calling her the Diva of the World.

00:16:00.890 --> 00:16:03.940
There's supposed to be an outdoor concert 
on the Zwei Island chain today.

00:16:04.280 --> 00:16:07.900
The Zwei Islands are pretty close 
to our current position.

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:09.280
That's so cool!

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:11.650
I wanna go.

00:16:12.120 --> 00:16:13.740
Let's go sometime.

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:15.780
Yeah! It's a promise.

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:18.920
Oh, yeah! I completely forgot.

00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:21.060
What should we get for lunch?

00:16:21.060 --> 00:16:22.290
Oh, Nii-san,

00:16:22.740 --> 00:16:25.540
I have a place I want to go.

00:16:26.260 --> 00:16:28.330
A place you want to go...

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:30.840
The cafeteria?

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:33.550
Yes. I've always wanted to come.

00:16:35.220 --> 00:16:37.050
What should I get?

00:16:37.320 --> 00:16:39.900
Salisbury steak, fried shrimp,

00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:42.030
potstickers, curry rice,

00:16:42.030 --> 00:16:44.360
stir-fried burdock, and...

00:16:44.360 --> 00:16:46.310
Hey, you're going to get sick.

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:49.730
But everything on the menu looks good...

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:51.570
Don't tell Miharu, okay?

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:54.570
If you don't finish it all, 
I'll eat it for you.

00:16:55.210 --> 00:16:56.880
I'll be fine.

00:16:56.880 --> 00:16:59.120
I'm going to have Nii-san eat it for me.

00:16:59.120 --> 00:16:59.740
Hmph.

00:17:03.190 --> 00:17:04.690
This is so good.

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:07.030
The food at the hospital is good, too,

00:17:07.030 --> 00:17:09.100
but this is different.

00:17:10.990 --> 00:17:13.150
You can have some of my 
pasta too, if you want.

00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:19.600
How is it?

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:20.860
It's great!

00:17:21.850 --> 00:17:25.430
B-But this isn't enough to
get on my good side, okay?

00:17:25.430 --> 00:17:27.260
What are you saying?

00:17:28.510 --> 00:17:30.480
Oh, Kisaragi Hayato.

00:17:32.010 --> 00:17:33.090
President.

00:17:33.510 --> 00:17:34.490
President?

00:17:34.760 --> 00:17:38.440
So that blonde with the drills is the one 
who put you through all of that?

00:17:37.180 --> 00:17:38.440
Hey, Karen!

00:17:38.440 --> 00:17:40.120
I already heard her.

00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:43.290
Who is that rude girl?

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:45.490
Sorry, this is my...

00:17:45.490 --> 00:17:47.260
She's Kisaragi Karen.

00:17:47.770 --> 00:17:49.750
Hayato-sama's little sister,

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:51.210
Claire-sama.

00:17:51.670 --> 00:17:53.050
Pleased to meet you.

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:55.890
I am Claire-sama's assistant,

00:17:55.890 --> 00:17:59.060
Chris Steinbelt, middle school second-year.

00:18:00.090 --> 00:18:02.460
Oh, nice to meet you.

00:18:02.460 --> 00:18:04.210
This is good timing.

00:18:04.210 --> 00:18:06.650
I actually have something 
to talk to you about.

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:08.730
Something to talk about?

00:18:09.130 --> 00:18:09.980
Yes.

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:13.730
I want you to help out the student council.

00:18:14.060 --> 00:18:14.730
Huh?

00:18:14.730 --> 00:18:16.250
Hold on a second.

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:19.230
Why does Hayato have to help out with that?

00:18:19.230 --> 00:18:22.410
The duel yesterday should have 
been settled with that tie.

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:24.670
There's no obligation for him 
to do as you say.

00:18:24.670 --> 00:18:25.620
Calm down.

00:18:25.620 --> 00:18:27.460
Of course it's not compulsory.

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:29.920
He's simply being recruited.

00:18:30.310 --> 00:18:30.810
Huh?

00:18:30.810 --> 00:18:32.220
Kisaragi Hayato,

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:35.350
I would like you to join Selections,

00:18:35.350 --> 00:18:37.970
a special unit under the student council.

00:18:38.270 --> 00:18:39.550
Selections?

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:44.800
You would follow orders from Warslarn HQ,
who manage the <i>Little Garden.</i>

00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:49.780
You would remain a student but execute
missions like a full-fledged Slayer would.

00:18:49.780 --> 00:18:53.520
The missions would include the guarding 
of various facilities, bodyguard duties,

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:56.830
and of course, actual combat with Savages.

00:18:57.320 --> 00:18:58.070
Combat...

00:19:00.170 --> 00:19:04.070
Due to the Savage nest 
elimination mission the other day,

00:19:04.070 --> 00:19:06.170
we don't have enough Slayers.

00:19:06.600 --> 00:19:08.480
We require immediate reinforcements.

00:19:08.970 --> 00:19:11.080
Just as Liddy said,

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:13.330
this is not compulsory.

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:15.950
However, I believe in

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:18.240
noblesse oblige!

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:19.720
Those with power

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:23.720
should wield it 
for the sake of those without it.

00:19:28.210 --> 00:19:30.670
But I don't think I...

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:33.310
Then I will join with Hayato.

00:19:33.750 --> 00:19:35.740
You do not meet the requirements.

00:19:35.740 --> 00:19:39.660
You have to be able to
fight head-on with a Savage.

00:19:39.660 --> 00:19:40.820
Or you'd drag everyone down.

00:19:41.970 --> 00:19:45.330
So, you want me to face
the president in a duel, too?

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:48.480
How disrespectful, Emile Crossfode!

00:19:48.480 --> 00:19:49.960
What can you do?!

00:19:50.400 --> 00:19:52.640
It doesn't have to be the president.

00:19:52.940 --> 00:19:55.820
Liddy Steinberg, I wouldn't mind
taking you on either.

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:58.760
That should be enough 
to show you my abilities.

00:19:58.760 --> 00:19:59.980
Damn you...

00:19:59.980 --> 00:20:01.580
When do you want to have the duel?

00:20:01.580 --> 00:20:04.050
I'm ready to go right now.

00:20:05.060 --> 00:20:06.790
Hundred On.

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:16.700
A dragoon type?

00:20:17.640 --> 00:20:21.030
Now, Vice President... 
are you in or not?

00:20:21.640 --> 00:20:23.090
Know your place.

00:20:23.390 --> 00:20:24.990
Hundred On.

00:20:32.970 --> 00:20:34.510
Liddy, stop it.

00:20:34.810 --> 00:20:35.950
Don't stop me, Erica.

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:39.550
I need to put him in his place, 
or it'll set a bad precedent.

00:20:40.050 --> 00:20:42.240
Now things are getting interesting.

00:20:42.240 --> 00:20:43.180
Stop it, Emile!

00:20:43.560 --> 00:20:45.170
Don't go off firing around here!

00:20:45.170 --> 00:20:46.530
Karen's here!

00:20:46.530 --> 00:20:47.700
I know.

00:20:47.700 --> 00:20:50.220
Then how about this?

00:20:51.590 --> 00:20:53.690
He changed the form of his armament?!

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:55.480
Here I go!

00:20:57.780 --> 00:20:58.840
Stop it!

00:20:58.840 --> 00:21:00.710
I'll stop you with force.

00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:02.550
Let them continue.

00:21:02.550 --> 00:21:03.530
Claire-sama.

00:21:06.520 --> 00:21:06.780
What?

00:21:09.900 --> 00:21:12.450
Weren't you supposed to put me in my place?!

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:14.300
Don't get so cocky!

00:21:23.910 --> 00:21:24.510
What?

00:21:24.510 --> 00:21:25.550
An alert?

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:28.060
Claire-sama, we have an order to sortie.

00:21:28.060 --> 00:21:28.820
Right.

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:30.760
Let's go, Liddy.

00:21:31.420 --> 00:21:32.860
Looks like I don't have a choice.

00:21:32.860 --> 00:21:34.360
You got out of this one.

00:21:34.360 --> 00:21:36.080
Oh, you're going to run?

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:37.290
That's not it.

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:41.250
Something more important came up 
than fighting you. That's all.

00:21:41.250 --> 00:21:42.780
President! What's going on?

00:21:43.330 --> 00:21:44.910
We have an emergency.

00:21:44.910 --> 00:21:48.660
We received word that the Savage 
have appeared on the Zwei Islands.

00:21:49.090 --> 00:21:50.510
The Zwei Islands?

00:21:50.810 --> 00:21:53.160
The place where Sakura-san was to perform.

00:21:53.520 --> 00:21:54.840
Kisaragi Hayato...

00:21:55.790 --> 00:21:59.310
I'll come to get your response 
on joining Selections later.

00:21:59.310 --> 00:22:01.350
Wait a second, Claire Harvey.

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:04.050
Charlotte Dimandius!

00:22:04.360 --> 00:22:06.050
Take them with you.

00:22:06.440 --> 00:22:07.670
What was that?

00:22:08.480 --> 00:22:11.960
Hayato-kun, looks like you'll be 
getting your first real battle.

00:22:12.880 --> 00:22:15.720
Are you ready to participate?

00:22:19.610 --> 00:22:20.940
<i>A real battle...</i>

00:22:21.950 --> 00:22:24.790
<i>A real battle with the Savage.</i>

00:24:00.960 --> 00:24:05.870
<b>Variant Awakening</b>
